gitea/tea was archived upstream on 2026-10-29 ("tea is replaced by gt").
The package stays at its last release, 0.16.0; its successor is packaged
here as gitea-cli.

While this file exists, scripts/upstream-archived.sh lets tea's watcher
accept the archived upstream. Remove it with the package, or when upstream
becomes active again (the watcher then turns red until it is gone).
